<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🍕 分數大作戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">通分、約分、四則混合！避開分母陷阱。連續答對分數翻倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area（寫出完整計算過程）</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>計算 3 × <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（整數×Fraction，P4 基礎）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>計算 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × 2 = ？（Fraction×整數）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>把 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 轉為假Fraction。再求 1<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 和 2<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 的假Fraction形式。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>約簡 <span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">15</span></span> 為最簡Fraction。（HCF(6,15) = ？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>找出 HCF(6, 8)、HCF(4, 10)、HCF(9, 12)。為甚麼交叉約分需要 HCF？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：Fraction×Fraction — 交叉約分法 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>FractionMultiplication法則：</strong><br/>
      ① 分子×分子、分母×分母：<span class="f"><span class="n">a</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">b</span></span> × <span class="f"><span class="n">c</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">d</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">a×c</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">b×d</span></span><br/>
      ② <strong>交叉約分（先約後乘）</strong>：Multiplication前先將任意<strong>分子</strong>與任意<strong>分母</strong>用 HCF 約簡<br/>
      ③ 優點：先約後乘 → 數字變小 → 少出錯 → 不用最後約分<br/>
      ④ 注意：約分只能在<strong>分子與分母之間</strong>，不能分子與分子、分母與分母！
      <div style="margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;">
<svg style="width:100%;max-width:480px;height:auto;" viewbox="0 0 480 200">
<!-- Title -->
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="240" y="16">Area模型：2/3 × 3/4 = ？</text>
