<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="344" y="108">÷3→1</text>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="399" y="108">÷3→1</text>
<!-- Simplified result -->
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="12" font-weight="700" x="370" y="130">=</text>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="14" font-weight="900" x="395" y="125">1</text>
<line stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="2" x1="385" x2="405" y1="130" y2="130"></line>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="14" font-weight="900" x="395" y="145">2</text>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 Trap引爆例題（本堂最重要的示範）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：<span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake（60% 學生）</div><div class="eq"><span class="fd"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span>（未約簡）</div><div class="why">直接乘完之後忘記約簡 → 不是最簡答案</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法（交叉約分）</div><div class="eq"><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span></div><div class="why">交叉約分：分子2與分母4約(HCF=2)→<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>×<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「交叉約分先出手，分子分母約一輪，剩下先乘後檢查，答案一定最簡分」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 最高頻錯誤：乘完 2/3×3/4=6/12 直接當答案 → 忘記約簡！交叉約分可避免此錯。</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 第二高頻錯誤：約分時分子約分子、分母約分母 → 這是錯的！只能「交叉」約（分子約分母）。</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 Worked Examples（必須先交叉約分，再乘）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例1</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？（提示：分子2與分母2約簡→<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例2</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> = ？（提示：分子3與分母9約、分子2與分母4約）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP2 + KP3 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：帶Fraction×Fraction — 先轉假Fraction法 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>帶FractionMultiplication標準流程：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>轉假Fraction</strong>：帶Fraction → 假Fraction（整數×分母＋分子）<br/>
      ② <strong>交叉約分</strong>：分子與分母之間約簡<br/>
      ③ <strong>分子×分子、分母×分母</strong><br/>
      ④ <strong>答案轉回</strong>：假Fraction → 帶Fraction（如需要）＋約簡<br/>
<strong>⚠️ 絕對禁止</strong>：帶Fraction直接乘！整數×整數＋Fraction×Fraction ≠ 正確答案！
      <div style="margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;">
<svg style="width:100%;max-width:480px;height:auto;" viewbox="0 0 480 120">
<!-- Wrong way -->
<rect fill="#FEF2F2" height="50" rx="6" stroke="#FECACA" stroke-width="1.5" width="200" x="10" y="10"></rect>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="110" y="28">❌ 錯誤做法</text>
<text fill="#991B1B" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="110" y="48">1又1/2 × 1又1/3</text>
<text fill="#991B1B" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" x="110" y="62">≠ (1×1) + (1/2×1/3) = 1又1/6</text>
<!-- Right way -->
<rect fill="#F0FDF4" height="50" rx="6" stroke="#BBF7D0" stroke-width="1.5" width="230" x="240" y="10"></rect>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="355" y="28">✅ Correct Approach</text>
<text fill="#14532D" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="355" y="48">1又1/2=3/2 → 3/2 × 1又1/3=4/3</text>
<text fill="#14532D" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" x="355" y="62">= 12/6 = 2</text>
<!-- Arrow -->
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="14" x="220" y="42">→</text>
<!-- Visual: mixed number breakdown -->
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="60" y="90">1又1/2 = 3/2</text>
<rect fill="#1A3C6D" height="16" rx="2" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1" width="30" x="20" y="96"></rect>
<text fill="#FFF" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle" x="35" y="108">1</text>
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="16" rx="2" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1" width="15" x="52" y="96"></rect>
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1" x1="67" x2="67" y1="96" y2="112"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle" x="60" y="108">1</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle" x="75" y="108">1</text>
<text fill="#C9A84C" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="160" y="90">1又1/3 = 4/3</text>
<rect fill="#C9A84C" height="16" rx="2" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1" width="30" x="120" y="96"></rect>
<text fill="#FFF" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle" x="135" y="108">1</text>
<rect fill="#FEF3C7" height="16" rx="2" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1" width="15" x="152" y="96"></rect>
<line stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1" x1="160" x2="160" y1="96" y2="112"></line>
<line stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1" x1="167" x2="167" y1="96" y2="112"></line>
<text fill="#92400E" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle" x="155" y="108">1</text>
<text fill="#92400E" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle" x="163" y="108">1</text>
<text fill="#92400E" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle" x="175" y="108">1</text>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="11" font-weight="700" x="300" y="105">3/2 × 4/3 = 12/6 = 2</text>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">轉假Fraction</div><div class="d">帶Fraction→<br/>假Fraction</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">交叉約分</div><div class="d">分子與分母<br/>用HCF約簡</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">相乘</div><div class="d">分子×分子<br/>分母×分母</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">轉回＋約簡</div><div class="d">假→帶Fraction<br/>最簡Fraction</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 Trap對比例題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：1<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 錯誤：帶Fraction直接乘</div><div class="eq">1×1 + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>×<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span></div><div class="why">完全錯誤！帶Fraction必須先轉假Fraction</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確：先轉假Fraction</div><div class="eq"><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span></div><div class="why">1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> → <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>×<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例3：1<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例4：2<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：三個Fraction連乘 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 進階</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>連Multiplication則：</strong><br/>
      ① 分子全部相乘、分母全部相乘<br/>
      ② <strong>全盤交叉約分</strong>：任何分子可與任何分母約（不限配對）<br/>
      ③ 建議：先全面約分 → 再乘 → 數字變超小！<br/>
      ④ 例：<span class="f"><span class="n">a</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">b</span></span>×<span class="f"><span class="n">c</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">d</span></span>×<span class="f"><span class="n">e</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">f</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">a×c×e</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">b×d×f</span></span>（先約後乘）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例5：<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（提示：分子1,2,3與分母2,3,4交叉約）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例6：<span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = ？</div></div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic（連乘版）：「連乘三兄弟，一起交叉約，約完再相乘，答案好簡單」</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 + 三 同步練習</div>
