<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：FractionMultiplicationWord Problems（呈分試文字題專項）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>解題四步法：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>圈關鍵詞</strong>（「…的…」= Multiplication！「×分之×」= Multiple關係）<br/>
      ② <strong>列乘式</strong>：看清誰是「被乘數」、誰是「乘數」<br/>
      ③ <strong>交叉約分計算</strong>：帶Fraction先轉假Fraction<br/>
      ④ <strong>寫完整答句</strong>（不寫答句扣步驟分！）<br/>
<strong>關鍵詞彙：</strong>「A 的 B 分之 C」 = A × <span class="f"><span class="n">C</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">B</span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例7：一個蛋糕的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 個，小明吃了其中的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>。小明吃了整個蛋糕的幾分之幾？（提示：「其中」的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> = Multiplication）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例8：一條繩子長 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 米，用去 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>。用去了多少米？（提示：帶Fraction先轉假Fraction再乘）</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">Word Problems練習（全部必做，列式 → 約分 → 計算 → 答句）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>一盒餅乾有 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 公斤，小美吃了其中的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>。小美吃了多少公斤？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>一瓶果汁有 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 升，小明倒了其中的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 出來。倒了多少升？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">27</td><td>一個Rectangle長 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 米，闊是長的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>。闊是多少米？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">28</td><td>哥哥有 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 公斤糖果，他把 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 送給弟弟。送出了多少公斤？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">29</td><td>媽媽做蛋糕用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 公斤麵粉，其中 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 用來做曲奇。做曲奇用了多少公斤麵粉？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">30</td><td>一條緞帶長 2<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 米，姊姊用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>。姊姊用了多少米？（以帶Fraction作答）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
