<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️3</td><td>糧倉有米 5<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 噸。第一星期用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>，第二星期用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>（注意：是「剩下的」還是「全部的」？）。Question說「第二星期用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>」，這裡指用了總量的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>。兩星期共用了多少噸？還剩多少噸？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
</table>
