<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> × <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)題（共 3 題，🚀 Optional）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>1<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>2<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>一個Rectangle花園的 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 種了花，花的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 是玫瑰。玫瑰佔整個花園的幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
