<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error</th><th>Correct Approach</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>交叉約分漏做</strong>：<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>×<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> 當答案</td><td>先交叉約分（分子2與分母4約→<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>×<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>）</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>帶Fraction未轉假Fraction直接乘</strong></td><td>帶FractionMultiplication第一步 = 轉假Fraction！無例外！</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>分子約分子、分母約分母</strong></td><td>約分只能在分子與分母之間（交叉），不能分子約分子！</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>結果未約簡</strong>：<span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">15</span></span> 當最終答案</td><td>最後必須檢查 HCF 再約簡。先交叉約分可避免此問題。</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>假Fraction未轉帶Fraction</strong></td><td>答案 &gt; 1 時，呈分試要求化為帶Fraction</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>連乘時只約一對就停</strong>：只約一對分子和分母，其他沒約</td><td>連乘時所有分子與所有分母都可以交叉約！全面約簡。</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Word Problems漏寫答句／漏單位</strong></td><td>必須寫「答：……」＋單位，否則扣步驟分</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="end-note">🪤 LF Academy · LF Academy · We don't teach math — we teach trap avoidance.。 · LF-P5-上-L09</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:4px;text-align:center;">📚 Related Topics：L07 異分母Fraction · L10 FractionWord Problems · L22 FractionDivision · Related Topics：L05 Multiplication認識 · L06 兩位數乘一位數 · L07 MultiplicationWord Problems</div>
</div>
</div>
