<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T9" data-hq-id="LF-T9-P5-0301">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T9</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T9-P5-0301</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Calculate 12 × 3/4 = ?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span>12×3÷4 but calculated 12/4×3=9… wait this is correct
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span>9 (12÷4×3=9)
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span>T9 Integers can only be reduced with the denominator. 12 and 4 reduce to 3, 3×3=9
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T9" data-hq-id="LF-T9-P5-0302">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T9</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T9-P5-0302</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Calculate 4/9 × 3/8 = ?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span>12/72 = 1/6 (multiplied directly without cross-reducing, then reduced)
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span>1/6
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span>T9 Cross-reduce: 4 and 8 reduce, 9 and 3 reduce → 1/3 × 1/2 = 1/6
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T9" data-hq-id="LF-T9-P5-0303">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T9</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T9-P5-0303</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Calculate 2 1/3 × 3/5 = ?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span>2 1/3 × 3/5 = 2 3/15
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span>7/3 × 3/5 = 7/5 = 1 2/5
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span>T9 Mixed number not converted to improper fraction before multiplying
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T9" data-hq-id="LF-T9-P5-0304">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T9</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T9-P5-0304</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Calculate 3/4 × 6/15 = ?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span>18/60 = 9/30
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span>Cross-reduce 3 and 15 reduce, 6 and 4 reduce → 1/2 × 3/5 = 3/10
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span>T9 Incomplete reduction or not knowing how to cross-reduce
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T?" data-hq-id="LF-T9-P5-0305">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T?</span>
