                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T9-P5-0305</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Calculate 8/10 × 5/12 = ?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span>40/120=1/3
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span>First reduce 8/10=4/5, 5/12→cross-reduce: 4/1×1/12=4/12=1/3 (same result but simpler process)
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
